// TAMF heuristic tactic: the state-carrier abstraction is deliberately
// co-designed with Tamarin's built-in 's' (smart) goal ranking. Per the
// Robustness Battery, --heuristic=s is a NECESSARY scope condition for the
// representation-level separation to be observable; the three alternative
// supported rankings {S, c, C} both time out (SECONDARY verdict).
//
// This file documents the intended invocation; the 's' ranking itself is
// Tamarin-native and needs no custom tactic. Kept for provenance/audit.
tactic: smart
ranking: s
note: "co-design contract; see preregistration/robustness_battery.md"
